+    // PEN-3328: return the canceller's promise instead of discarding it.
+    // `cancel()` on an EXECUTING statement dials a fresh connection to send a
+    // CancelRequest, and that dial rejects asynchronously when it fails --
+    // connection.js `cancel` has both `catch (error) { reject(error) }` around
